---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Healing Tools | Healing the Heart" description="Instructions, the Lie and Emotional Needs tool, and an interactive feelings wheel for Healing the Heart.">
  <section class="tools-shell">
    <div class="tools-tabs-wrap">
      <nav class="tools-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Healing tools">
        <button class="tools-tab active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="panel-instructions" data-tab="instructions">Instructions</button>
        <button class="tools-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-tool" data-tab="tool">Lies / Emotional Needs Tool</button>
        <button class="tools-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-feelings" data-tab="feelings">Feelings Wheel</button>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <section id="panel-instructions" class="tools-panel active" role="tabpanel" data-panel="instructions">
      <div class="instructions-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Start here</p>
        <h1>Understand the trigger. Discover the need. Find healing.</h1>
        <p>Pain often shows up first as a reaction—a moment that hurt, frustrated, angered, embarrassed, or triggered us. You do not have to know the lie underneath it yet. Start with what happened, and this tool will help you explore what may have been touched, what emotional need may be underneath it, and where truth and healing can begin.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="instructions-grid">
        <article class="instructions-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">How it helps</p>
          <div class="instruction-steps">
            <div><span>01</span><p><strong>Start with what happened.</strong> Describe a situation, conversation, thought, or event that upset, hurt, frustrated, or triggered you. You do not need to know what lie you may be believing—the tool will help you explore what may be underneath it.</p></div>
            <div><span>02</span><p><strong>Find the feeling.</strong> If it helps, use the <button class="text-tab-link" type="button" data-go-tab="feelings">Feelings Wheel</button> to put language to what is happening inside.</p></div>
            <div><span>03</span><p><strong>Locate the need.</strong> See which of the 10 emotional needs may be underneath the trigger or reaction: Acceptance, Affection, Attention, Affirmation, Security, Comfort, Encouragement, Support, Appreciation, or Respect.</p></div>
            <div><span>04</span><p><strong>Receive truth.</strong> Use the Scriptures and practices to replace lies with truth and meet with God in a concrete way.</p></div>
            <div><span>05</span><p><strong>Walk it out.</strong> Small daily practices help form new pathways so your default becomes turning to God when your cup feels empty.</p></div>
          </div>
          <button class="button primary start-tool" type="button" data-go-tab="tool"><span>Open the Lie / Emotional Needs Tool</span><strong>Start here →</strong></button>
        </article>

        <aside class="prayer-card">
          <p class="eyebrow light">Prayer before you begin</p>
          <p class="prayer">“Jesus, You are gentle and lowly—humble, gentle, and unpretentious; the opposite of proud or self-exalting—in heart. As I name these lies and needs, meet me with Your truth and presence. Teach my heart to receive from You, and form in me a new way of living loved. Amen.”</p>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="tips-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">A few tips</p>
        <h2>Walk through your healing gently.</h2>
        <p>Don't be harsh on yourself. Bring what you find to Jesus. Go slowly. Grief and exchange take time; healing is a process. Invite support. Share what you're working through with a safe friend, Pastor, or Healing the Heart Facilitator.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="facilitator-card">
        <div class="facilitator-copy">
          <div class="mail-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 5h18a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Zm0 3.2V17h18V8.2l-9 5.7-9-5.7Zm1.1-1.2L12 12l7.9-5H4.1Z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Need support?</p>
          <h2>Reach out to a Facilitator</h2>
          <p>You do not have to process everything alone. Send us a note and someone from Healing the Heart can follow up.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="facilitator-form" class="facilitator-form" method="post" action="/api/contact">
          <input class="honeypot" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />
          <input type="hidden" name="topic" value="Lie / Emotional Needs Tool - Facilitator Request" />
          <label>Name<input name="name" required autocomplete="name" /></label>
          <label>Email Address<input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" /></label>
          <label>What's on your mind?<textarea name="message" required></textarea></label>
          <button class="button primary" type="submit">Send to a Facilitator</button>
          <p id="facilitator-status" class="form-status" hidden aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="panel-tool" class="tools-panel" role="tabpanel" data-panel="tool" hidden>
      <div class="tool-page">
        <div class="tool-intro">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Lie → Need</p>
            <h1>What got touched?</h1>
            <p>Start with what happened—a situation, conversation, thought, trigger, or lie. You do not have to know the lie yet. Describe the moment, and the tool will help you look underneath the reaction.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-note"><span>START</span><p>You do not need the perfect words. One real moment at a time usually gives the clearest result.</p></div>
        </div>

        <div class="input-card">
          <div class="input-prompt"><span></span><strong>No need to know the lie yet—just start with what happened.</strong></div>
          <label for="mainText">What happened, or what are you reacting to?</label>
          <textarea id="mainText" rows="5" maxlength="250" placeholder='Examples: "I got angry when they ignored what I said" or "I helped everyone and nobody even noticed"'></textarea>
          <div class="input-footer">
            <span>Press Enter to analyze • Shift + Enter for a new line</span>
            <span id="charCounter">0 / 250</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-actions">
            <button id="analyzeBtn" class="button primary analyze-primary" type="button">Help me understand this →</button>
            <button id="clearBtn" class="button outline" type="button">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <div id="status" class="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
        </div>

        <div id="results" class="results" hidden>
          <div class="results-heading">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">Your reflection</p><h2>Look at the heart beneath the reaction.</h2></div>
            <div id="needPills" class="need-pills" aria-label="Likely emotional needs"></div>
          </div>

          <section class="result-card result-card-main">
            <div class="result-number">01</div>
            <div class="result-body">
              <p class="result-kicker">What may have been touched</p>
              <h3 id="touchedText">—</h3>
              <div class="result-subsection"><span class="sub-label">Possible feelings</span><div id="feelings" class="chip-row"></div></div>
              <div class="result-subsection"><span class="sub-label">Possible lies</span><div id="liesList" class="lie-list"></div></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="result-card">
            <div class="result-number">02</div>
            <div class="result-body">
              <p class="result-kicker">Suggested next step</p>
              <h3>Work through what surfaced.</h3>
              <ol id="stepsList" class="steps-list"></ol>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="result-card truth-card">
            <div class="result-number">03</div>
            <div class="result-body">
              <p class="result-kicker">Truth for this area</p>
              <h3>Bring truth to the need underneath it.</h3>
              <div id="resources" class="resource-grid"></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <div class="email-card">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Keep a copy</p>
              <h3>Email this reflection to yourself.</h3>
              <p>Send the result so you can return to it later for prayer, journaling, or conversation with a facilitator.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="email-controls">
              <input id="resultEmail" type="email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="name@example.com" aria-label="Email address" />
              <button id="emailBtn" class="button primary" type="button">Email my results</button>
            </div>
            <p id="emailStatus" class="email-status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
          </div>

          <p class="disclaimer">This tool is a guide for reflection and prayer, not a diagnosis. Hold the suggestions lightly and process them with God and safe people.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="panel-feelings" class="tools-panel" role="tabpanel" data-panel="feelings" hidden>
      <div class="feelings-page">
        <div class="feelings-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Feelings Wheel</p>
          <h1>Put language to what you feel.</h1>
          <p>Start broad, then narrow it down. On your phone, the wheel becomes a simple guided picker so you can move from a big feeling to the exact word that fits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wheel-card">
          <div id="feeling-panel" class="feeling-panel">
            <strong>Hover or tap a feeling</strong>
            <div>A brief definition will appear here.</div>
          </div>
          <div id="feelings-wheel" class="wheel-canvas"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="mobile-guided-wrap">
          <div class="mobile-guided-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow">Guided mode</p>
            <h2>Not sure where to start?</h2>
            <p>Use the same wheel one step at a time. Start broad, then narrow it down until a word feels right.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="mobile-feelings-picker" class="mobile-feelings-picker"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="wheel-next">
          <span>Found the feeling?</span>
          <button type="button" class="button primary" data-go-tab="tool">Take it to the Lie → Need Tool</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>

  <script is:inline src="https://code.highcharts.com/highcharts.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://code.highcharts.com/modules/sunburst.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="/lies-feelings-wheel.js"></script>

  <script is:inline>
    const tabButtons = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]'));
    const tabPanels = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]'));

    function activateTab(name, updateHash = true) {
      const valid = ['instructions', 'tool', 'feelings'].includes(name) ? name : 'instructions';
      tabButtons.forEach((button) => {
        const active = button.dataset.tab === valid;
        button.classList.toggle('active', active);
        button.setAttribute('aria-selected', active ? 'true' : 'false');
      });
      tabPanels.forEach((panel) => {
        const active = panel.dataset.panel === valid;
        panel.classList.toggle('active', active);
        panel.hidden = !active;
      });
      if (updateHash) history.replaceState(null, '', valid === 'instructions' ? location.pathname : '#' + valid);
      if (valid === 'feelings' && window.initHthFeelingsWheel) {
        setTimeout(() => window.initHthFeelingsWheel(), 30);
      }
      window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
    }

    tabButtons.forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => activateTab(button.dataset.tab)));
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-go-tab]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => activateTab(button.dataset.goTab)));
    const initialTab = location.hash.replace('#', '');
    activateTab(initialTab || 'instructions', false);

    const facilitatorForm = document.querySelector('#facilitator-form');
    const facilitatorStatus = document.querySelector('#facilitator-status');
    facilitatorForm?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const button = facilitatorForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
      button.disabled = true;
      button.textContent = 'Sending…';
      facilitatorStatus.hidden = true;
      try {
        const response = await fetch(facilitatorForm.action, { method:'POST', body:new FormData(facilitatorForm) });
        const data = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error(data.error || 'We could not send your message.');
        facilitatorForm.reset();
        facilitatorStatus.textContent = 'Sent. A facilitator can follow up with you.';
        facilitatorStatus.hidden = false;
      } catch (error) {
        facilitatorStatus.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'We could not send your message.';
        facilitatorStatus.hidden = false;
      } finally {
        button.disabled = false;
        button.textContent = 'Send to a Facilitator';
      }
    });

    const MAX_INPUT_LENGTH = 250;
    let currentResult = null;
    const input = document.querySelector('#mainText');
    const counter = document.querySelector('#charCounter');
    const analyzeBtn = document.querySelector('#analyzeBtn');
    const clearBtn = document.querySelector('#clearBtn');
    const status = document.querySelector('#status');
    const results = document.querySelector('#results');
    const needPills = document.querySelector('#needPills');
    const touchedText = document.querySelector('#touchedText');
    const feelingChips = document.querySelector('#feelings');
    const liesList = document.querySelector('#liesList');
    const stepsList = document.querySelector('#stepsList');
    const resources = document.querySelector('#resources');
    const resultEmail = document.querySelector('#resultEmail');
    const emailBtn = document.querySelector('#emailBtn');
    const emailStatus = document.querySelector('#emailStatus');

    const esc = (value) => String(value ?? '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, (char) => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[char]));
    const list = (value) => Array.isArray(value) ? value.filter(Boolean) : [];

    function updateCounter() {
      if (input.value.length > MAX_INPUT_LENGTH) input.value = input.value.slice(0, MAX_INPUT_LENGTH);
      counter.textContent = input.value.length + ' / ' + MAX_INPUT_LENGTH;
    }

    function showStatus(message, kind = 'neutral') {
      status.textContent = message;
      status.dataset.kind = kind;
      status.hidden = !message;
    }

    function renderResult(result) {
      const needs = list(result.needs);
      const possibleFeelings = list(result.possible_feelings);
      const possibleLies = list(result.possible_lies);
      const steps = list(result.suggested_steps);
      const resourceRows = list(result.resources);

      needPills.innerHTML = needs.length ? needs.map((need) => '<span>' + esc(need) + '</span>').join('') : '<span>Reflection</span>';
      touchedText.textContent = result.what_got_touched || 'This may have touched a deeper place in the heart.';
      feelingChips.innerHTML = possibleFeelings.length ? possibleFeelings.map((feeling) => '<span class="chip">' + esc(feeling) + '</span>').join('') : '<span class="muted-note">No feelings suggested.</span>';
      liesList.innerHTML = possibleLies.length ? possibleLies.map((lie) => '<div class="lie-item"><span></span><p>' + esc(lie) + '</p></div>').join('') : '<p class="muted-note">No possible lies returned.</p>';
      stepsList.innerHTML = steps.length ? steps.map((step) => '<li><span>' + esc(step) + '</span></li>').join('') : '<li><span>No next steps returned.</span></li>';

      resources.innerHTML = resourceRows.length ? resourceRows.map((resource) => {
        const scriptures = list(resource.scriptures);
        const practices = list(resource.recommended_practices);
        return '<article class="resource-card"><div class="resource-head"><span class="need-label">Emotional need</span><h4>' +
          esc(resource.need || 'This area') + '</h4>' +
          (resource.description ? '<p>' + esc(resource.description) + '</p>' : '') +
          '</div><div class="resource-columns"><div><span class="sub-label">Suggested Scriptures</span>' +
          (scriptures.length ? '<ul>' + scriptures.map((item) => '<li>' + esc(item) + '</li>').join('') + '</ul>' : '<p class="muted-note">No scriptures found.</p>') +
          '</div><div><span class="sub-label">Recommended Practice</span>' +
          (practices.length ? '<ul>' + practices.map((item) => '<li>' + esc(item).replace(/\n/g, '<br>') + '</li>').join('') + '</ul>' : '<p class="muted-note">No practice found.</p>') +
          '</div></div></article>';
      }).join('') : '<p class="muted-note">No resources were returned.</p>';

      results.hidden = false;
      results.scrollIntoView({ behavior:'smooth', block:'start' });
    }

    async function analyze() {
      const text = input.value.trim();
      currentResult = null;
      results.hidden = true;
      emailStatus.hidden = true;
      if (!text) {
        showStatus('Type a lie, thought, trigger, or brief situation first.', 'error');
        input.focus();
        return;
      }
      analyzeBtn.disabled = true;
      analyzeBtn.textContent = 'Looking underneath this…';
      showStatus('Looking at what may have been touched…', 'loading');
      try {
        const response = await fetch('/api/lies/analyze', {
          method:'POST',
          headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},
          body:JSON.stringify({text})
        });
        const data = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error(data.error || 'Something went wrong. Please try again.');
        currentResult = data;
        showStatus('');
        renderResult(data);
      } catch (error) {
        showStatus(error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'Something went wrong. Please try again.', 'error');
      } finally {
        analyzeBtn.disabled = false;
        analyzeBtn.textContent = 'Help me understand this →';
      }
    }

    function clearTool() {
      input.value = '';
      currentResult = null;
      results.hidden = true;
      showStatus('');
      emailStatus.hidden = true;
      resultEmail.value = '';
      updateCounter();
      input.focus();
    }

    async function emailResult() {
      const email = resultEmail.value.trim();
      if (!currentResult) {
        emailStatus.textContent = 'Analyze something first.';
        emailStatus.hidden = false;
        return;
      }
      if (!email || !/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email)) {
        emailStatus.textContent = 'Enter a valid email address.';
        emailStatus.hidden = false;
        resultEmail.focus();
        return;
      }
      emailBtn.disabled = true;
      emailBtn.textContent = 'Sending…';
      emailStatus.hidden = true;
      try {
        const response = await fetch('/api/lies/email', {
          method:'POST',
          headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},
          body:JSON.stringify({email,result:currentResult})
        });
        const data = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error(data.error || 'Email could not be sent.');
        emailStatus.textContent = 'Sent. Check your inbox.';
        emailStatus.hidden = false;
      } catch (error) {
        emailStatus.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'Email could not be sent.';
        emailStatus.hidden = false;
      } finally {
        emailBtn.disabled = false;
        emailBtn.textContent = 'Email my results';
      }
    }

    input?.addEventListener('input', updateCounter);
    input?.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
      if (event.key === 'Enter' && !event.shiftKey) {
        event.preventDefault();
        analyze();
      }
    });
    analyzeBtn?.addEventListener('click', analyze);
    clearBtn?.addEventListener('click', clearTool);
    emailBtn?.addEventListener('click', emailResult);
    updateCounter();
  </script>

  <style is="global">
    .tools-shell{min-height:70vh;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f4efe6 0%,#fbf8f2 42%,#f4efe6 100%)}
    .tools-tabs-wrap{position:sticky;top:67px;z-index:15;padding:0 5vw;background:rgba(255,253,248,.93);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .tools-tabs{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:.65rem;overflow-x:auto;padding:.85rem 0}
    .tools-tab{flex:0 0 auto;min-height:48px;border:1px solid rgba(32,37,34,.12);background:#f7f2ea;padding:.9rem 1.2rem;border-radius:999px;font:900 .86rem var(--sans);color:#4d5953;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(56,43,30,.04);transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease,background .15s ease}
    .tools-tab:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 7px 18px rgba(56,43,30,.08)}
    .tools-tab.active{background:var(--deep);border-color:var(--deep);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(38,55,50,.2)}
    .tools-tab[data-tab="tool"]{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e97832,#cb5525);border-color:#c95424;color:#fff;min-width:225px;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(214,107,50,.24)}
    .tools-tab[data-tab="tool"].active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#263732,#1b2925);border-color:#1b2925;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(38,55,50,.28)}
    .tools-panel{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:4.5rem 5vw 6rem}
    .tools-panel[hidden]{display:none!important}
    .instructions-hero{max-width:860px;margin-bottom:2.4rem}
    .instructions-hero h1,.tool-intro h1,.feelings-intro h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6rem);margin:.2rem 0 1.1rem}
    .instructions-hero>p:last-child,.tool-intro>div:first-child>p:last-child,.feelings-intro>p:last-child{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem;max-width:800px}
    .instructions-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:1rem;align-items:stretch}
    .instructions-card,.prayer-card,.tips-card,.facilitator-card,.wheel-card,.input-card,.result-card,.email-card{border:1px solid rgba(32,37,34,.1);border-radius:24px}
    .instructions-card{padding:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem);background:#fffdf8}
    .instruction-steps{display:grid;gap:.25rem;margin:1.1rem 0 1.5rem}
    .instruction-steps>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px 1fr;gap:.8rem;padding:.85rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .instruction-steps>div:last-child{border-bottom:0}
    .instruction-steps span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#f1e4d1;color:#8a5b33;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:900}
    .instruction-steps p{margin:.15rem 0;color:#59635e}
    .instruction-steps strong{color:var(--ink)}
    .text-tab-link{border:0;padding:0;background:transparent;color:#9a5e35;font:inherit;font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer}
    .start-tool{width:100%;min-height:66px!important;padding:1rem 1.25rem!important;border-radius:18px!important;display:flex!important;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;font-size:.95rem!important;box-shadow:0 14px 28px rgba(214,107,50,.24)!important}
    .start-tool span{font-weight:900}.start-tool strong{font-size:1.02rem;white-space:nowrap}
    .prayer-card{padding:2rem;background:var(--deep);color:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
    .prayer-card .eyebrow{color:#f2c56e}
    .prayer{margin:0;font:italic 400 1.2rem/1.7 var(--serif);color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)}
    .tips-card{margin-top:1rem;padding:1.7rem 2rem;background:#efe5d7}
    .tips-card h2{font-size:2rem;margin:.2rem 0 .7rem}
    .tips-card>p:last-child{margin:0;color:#5d625e}
    .facilitator-card{margin-top:1rem;padding:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem);background:#fff;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:2.5rem}
    .mail-icon{width:58px;height:58px;margin-bottom:1rem}
    .mail-icon svg{width:100%;height:100%;fill:var(--deep)}
    .facilitator-copy h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);margin:.15rem 0 .7rem}
    .facilitator-copy>p:last-child{color:var(--muted)}
    .facilitator-form{display:grid;gap:1rem}
    .facilitator-form label{display:grid;gap:.38rem;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800}
    .facilitator-form input,.facilitator-form textarea{width:100%;padding:.85rem .95rem;border:1px solid rgba(32,37,34,.16);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;font:inherit}
    .facilitator-form textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .honeypot{position:absolute!important;left:-9999px!important}
    .form-status{margin:0;padding:.8rem 1rem;border-radius:12px;background:#edf1ed;color:#445a50}
    .tool-page,.feelings-page{max-width:1050px;margin:0 auto}
    #panel-tool{padding-top:3.2rem}
    .tool-intro{position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:2rem;align-items:end;margin-bottom:0;padding:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3.1rem);border-radius:32px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 88% 12%,rgba(242,181,94,.32),transparent 28%),linear-gradient(135deg,#1e302b 0%,#314b42 65%,#3f594e 100%);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 28px 70px rgba(31,48,43,.22)}
